WEBVTT

00:05:58.636 --> 00:06:01.796
primarily because of
the extended droughts.

00:06:02.236 --> 00:06:04.956
And when the temperatures go up,
the fires get a lot worse

00:06:04.996 --> 00:06:08.996
and the worst fires in California
and western US history

00:06:09.036 --> 00:06:11.676
have been in the last two years.

00:06:11.676 --> 00:06:14.276
Also in Siberia, in Australia,

00:06:14.316 --> 00:06:15.956
in southern Europe.

00:06:15.956 --> 00:06:17.836
It doesn’t have to ruin your golf game.

00:06:17.876 --> 00:06:19.596
And this is a serious point,

00:06:19.636 --> 00:06:23.276
because we can't let these conditions
become the new normal.

00:06:23.276 --> 00:06:25.036
It's not fine.

00:06:25.876 --> 00:06:28.756
And this is an example
of why it's not fine.

00:06:28.796 --> 00:06:31.836
A lightning strike
hitting a natural gas leak